      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "FixAnything - Wan2.1 I2V 14B 480P\n\nFiles:\n  models/diffusion_models/  wan2.1_i2v_480p_14B_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors\n  models/loras/             fixanything_lora.safetensors\n  models/vae/               wan_2.1_vae.safetensors\n  models/clip_vision/       clip_vision_h.safetensors\n  models/text_encoders/     prompt_embeds.pt\n\nThe lora loader adds the diffusion_model. prefix the lora keys are missing.\nThe prompt embeds node replaces umT5, so no text encoder is needed.\n\nFrames: the video must be 61 frames. The last frame is repeated 4 times to\nmake 65 (4n+1), and the final Get Image from Batch cuts those 4 back off.\n\nclean_frame_indices lists the frames to keep as they are. 0 60 61 62 63 64\nmeans first frame, last frame, and the 4 repeats of it.\n\nSampler: euler + simple + shift 5 matches the original FlowMatchScheduler\nexactly. Other schedulers do not."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
